    "detailed_description": "A researcher receives an e-mail from Government Officials to meet in a remote location. When he drives there, he suddenly realizes there is a secret city in this location. He tries to figure out the purpose of this city and why he is there.<br><br>The game is a third person driving experience. An adventure of a professional to a cult-like organisation. An effortlessly creepy atmosphere, a thriller, a chilling mood. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024890/extras/70b6a3095d00fcb888f30a9820d36d74.avif?t=1738153851\" width=500 height=348 /></span>.<br><br>The City: An unholy land. A beautiful city with bad intentions. Gorgeous night visions. I have carefully modelled the city with a fitting architecture. Its creepyness is like De Chirico paintings. Shockingly naked architecture will creep you out! You can look around with your mouse anytime!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024890/extras/4931363f96875ca7e9e1dd50713637d3.avif?t=1738153851\" width=500 height=414 /></span>.  <br><br>Exploration: You will be directed by a man from walkie-talkie to finish the tasks. You don't know if anything will happen and don't know why this place even exist. A map, a paper of some sort and a book will lead you to some secrets.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024890/extras/3414ee7a8b7b301a885bf2f1f0eb7646.avif?t=1738153851\" width=700 height=394 /></span>.  <br><br>Cut-Scenes: Game contains lots of cut-scenes with cinematic angles and great music!<br><br>Do you like creepy places without any try-hard atmosphere? A chilling experience without a cheap jumpscare? A book and map related mystery solving? Then this game is for you!<br><br>By purchasing this game you will have a 